change_type: instructions+code   changelog: Clarify Playwright install workflow and CLI auth-file help

### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- # 安装 Playwright（如果尚未安装）
- npm install -g playwright
- # 或者本地安装
- npm install playwright
- # 安装浏览器
+ 说明：
+ # 在 skill 目录内安装依赖（包含 playwright）
+ npm install
+ # 安装浏览器二进制
+ - 请在 skill 目录内执行 `npm install`，这样 `node ./scripts/*.js` 才能稳定加载本地 `playwright` 依赖
+ - `npx playwright install chromium` 会联网下载 Chromium 浏览器二进制

